Union-Find data structure

* Aset of elements S partitioned into subsets, or
components, {Ci,C2,...,Cx}

* Each s in S belongs to exactly one C;
* Support the following operations

* MakeUnionFind(S) — set up initial components,
each s in S is a separate singleton component {s}

* Find(s) — returns the component containing s

* Union(C,C’) — merges the components C and C’

